  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: webob 1.8.8+rhlw.1",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released webob 1.8.8+rhlw.1 with backported fixes for CVE-2026-54770 and CVE-2026-44889.\n\nCVE-2026-54770: WebOb: Open redirect in Location header normalization via leading C0 control / space characters\n\nCVE-2026-44889: WebOb: Location header normalization during redirect leads to open redirect\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for webob 1.8.8 from PyPI.",
